9
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,550
I'll be out in two minutes

10
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,870
and i promise you

11
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,030
Without your permission in the future

12
00:00:24,030 --> 00:00:25,390
I won't step foot into this house

13
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:26,870
You can sleep peacefully

14
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:28,310
Hey Hey

15
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:35,900
Is it okay after checking?

16
00:00:36,380 --> 00:01:11,380
Why can't I fall asleep? He slept here before leaving.
